常與筠及劉孝綽陸倕到洽殷鈞等遊宴玄圃"},{"pdf_page":85,"half":"右","leaf":"二十三下","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"太子獨執筠袖撫孝綽肩曰所謂左把浮丘袖右拍洪"},{"pdf_page":85,"half":"右","leaf":"二十三下","column_from_right":10,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"崖肩其見重如此筠又與殷鈞以方雅見禮後為中書"},{"pdf_page":85,"half":"左","leaf":"二十四上","column_from_right":1,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"郎奉敕製開善寺寶誌法師碑文辭甚麗逸又敕撰中"},{"pdf_page":85,"half":"左","leaf":"二十四上","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":15,"text":"書表奏三十卷及所上賦頌都為一集"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004","text":"累遷太子洗馬，中舍人，並掌東宮管記。昭明太子愛文學士，常與筠及劉孝綽、陸倕、到洽、殷鈞等游宴玄圃，太子獨執筠袖，撫孝綽肩曰：「所謂左把浮丘袖，右拍洪崖肩。」其見重如此。筠又與殷鈞以方雅見禮。後爲中書郎，奉敕制開善寺寶志法師碑文，辭甚麗逸。又敕撰中書表奏三十卷，及所上賦頌都爲一集。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":18,"end":22,"surface":"昭明太子","id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0018","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作蕭統。"},{"start":23,"end":26,"surface":"文學士","id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:u0023","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"東宮文學之士合稱"},{"start":29,"end":30,"surface":"筠","id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0029","person_id":"mxz_qw8_acd_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作筠。"},{"start":31,"end":34,"surface":"劉孝綽","id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0031","person_id":"di1_zqb_t0f","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉孝綽。"},{"start":35,"end":37,"surface":"陸倕","id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0035","person_id":"war_qdw_fs5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作陸倕。"},{"start":38,"end":40,"surface":"到洽","id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0038","person_id":"4mr_j4p_k5h","kind":"person","status":"contextual